# The repository stores text with LF, always.
#
# Not cosmetic. This repo is edited from a Windows checkout and deployed to a
# Linux VPS, and without this a file that made the round trip came back with
# every line marked as changed — a twenty-line edit to format.js showed up as
# 633 lines of churn, which is the kind of diff nobody reads to the end of.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Except the things that are not text and must never be rewritten.
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
